,"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":111,"row":{"en":"Ponder what scenarios might evolve that breach your ability to absorb negative impact or exploit risks.","wo":"Xalaatal ci senaario yi lay may nga daan xalaat yu baaxul yi ak nga mën xam nooy gerer risk yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalatal ci scénario yi lay may nga dan khalat you bakhoul yi ak nga meun kham noy gérer risque yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":112,"row":{"en":"Dear Sir","wo":"Sama Sëriñ sama Soppe","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama Serigne sama sopé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":113,"row":{"en":"Rose feels overwhelmed, depressed, guilty, scared, and lonely.","wo":"Rose defa melni kuñu bunduxatal, ku taggok sago, ku tiit, ak ku wéet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRose dafa melni kouniou boundoukhatal, kou taggok sago, kou tiite, ak kou wéte.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":114,"row":{"en":"Federal agents conducted additional searches across Florida.","wo":"Agent federoo yi amal nañu yeneen seet ci biir Floride.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAgent federoo yi amal nagnou yenen sete thi biir floride.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":115,"row":{"en":"Extremely wide and extremely fast for shooting anything handheld in decent light.","wo":"Gaaw lool, yaatu lool ci tiire nataal, lépp ànd ak lumiere bu yam ci loxo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGaw lol, yaatou lol thi tire nataal, leup and ak lumiere bou yam thi lokho.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":116,"row":{"en":"Let’s reject, break and bind the forces that seek to control and pervert the destiny of Nigeria.","wo":"Nanu dàq, dog, tënk bépp doole buy fexe numu naxasalee ëlëgu Nigeria.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNagnou dak dog teunk bepp dolé bouy fékhé nimou nahassalé eulégu Nigeria.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":117,"row":{"en":"One recipe in particular caught my eye.","wo":"Mu am ci