cialized or if they are feeling threatened.","wo":"Waaye dafay am solo lool ñu xamni xaj buñu tàggat bu baax sax mën na songe sudee miina luñu ko nit bu baax wala sudee daa am luko tiital.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé dafay am solo lol gnou khamni khadj bouniou taggat bou bakh sakh meun na songué soudé minna louniou ko nitt bou bakh wala soudé da am louko tiital.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":124,"row":{"en":"A man and a woman are waiting for a train.] Man: I love trains.","wo":"Ku góor ak ku jigéen ñu ngi xaar saxaar gi.] Ku góor ki: Dama bëgg saxaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ak kou djiguéne gnoungui khar sakhar gui. Kou goor ki: Dama beug sakhar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":125,"row":{"en":"Mama reaches in the envelope and pulls out a letter written in a deliberate, thoughtful script.","wo":"Mama dafa dugal luxoom ci envelop bi, daal di ciy génne ab bataaxal ci nimu ko soobe te bàyyi ci xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMama dafa dougal loukhoom ci enveloppe bi, daldi thié guéné ab bataakhal thi nimou ko sobé té bayi thi khél.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":126,"row":{"en":"Tom is a good man, and he loves Josephine very much.","wo":"Tom nit ku baax la, te bëgg na lool Josephine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTom nitt kou bakh la té beugue na lool Joséphine.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":127,"row":{"en":"She eventually died of a morphine overdose, leaving her kittens behind.","wo":"Ginaaw noonu mu faatu ndax drog, bàyyi ganaaw muusam yu ndaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGuinaw nonou mou fatou ndakh drogue, bayi ganaw moussame you ndaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":128,"row":{"en":"Unfortunately, experience alone is not enough without current knowledge.","wo":"Li leer mooy yàgg liggéey rek doyul sudee àndul ak xam-xam bi war.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi leer moy yagg liguey rek doyoul soudé andoul ak kham kham bi war.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":129,"row":{"en":"The library desk clerk was able to help a police artist draw up a portrait of the suspect who left in such a hurry.","wo":"Ndaw li yor bibliotek bi moo jàppale polisiye bi bu desine kanamu waa ji gaawantu dem te ñu ñaaw njortu ci moom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdaaw li yorr bibliotheque bi mo japalé polisyé bi bou dessiné kanamou wa dji gaawantou dem té gnou niaw gnortou thi moom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":130,"row":{"en":"We both filled out a questionnaire and answered some questions about our health history.","wo":"Nu bokk joxe leeral yi nu laaj ci kesioneer bi, ba noppi tontu ay laaj ci jafe-jafe wérgi-yaram yu nu musa am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou bokk diokhé leeral yi gnou ladj thi kessioner bi ba noppi tontou ay ladj thi diafé diafé wergui yaram you gnou meussa ame\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":131,"row":{"en":"Customer: I like that. It's perfect for my living room.","wo":"Kiliyaan bi: Bëgg naa loolu. Dina baax ci sama saal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nClient bi: beugue naa lolou dina bakh si sama salle\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":132,"row":{"en":"The finance guy sat in a dress shirt behind a massive wood desk.","wo":"Waaji yor wallu koppar yi defa toogoon ci ginnàaw benn biro bant mu sol benn simis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWadji yorr wallou koppar yi dafa togone thi guinaw benn biro bant mou sol benn simis.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":133,"row":{"en":"The veteran sat alone in the hospital room, staring at the blank television.","wo":"Soldaar ba woon a ngi toog moom kese ci saalu hopitaal bi, di xool tele bu amul dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoldat ba wone a ngui togue mom kessé thi salou hopital bi, di khole télé bou amoul dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":134,"row":{"en":"Independent repair shops are often less expensive than dealerships, but they may not have the same level of expertise.","wo":"Gaaraasu mekanisien yi ñoo gëna yomb ay mbir konsesioneer yi, waaye seen xam-xam moo gëna néew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGaaraasou mecanicien yi nio geuna yomb ay mbir konsesioneer yi wayé sen kham-kham mo geuna néw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":135,"row":{"en":"I bought a dozen roses, all different colors.","wo":"Ma jënd duusenu rose, ci melo yi am yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa dieund douzaine rose si mélo yi ame yeupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":136,"row":{"en":"We had sandwiches, chips, fruit, and cookies.","wo":"Amoon nanu ay sàndiis, sips, fruit ak kukiis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmon nagnou ay sàndiiss, sips, fruit ak koukiiss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":137,"row":{"en":"Hey there, how's it going?","wo":"Nanga def, ci loo nekk?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNanga def si loo nek ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":138,"row":{"en":"He would sit on the street corner, surrounded by his tools and materials, and invite passersby to watch him work.","wo":"Dafa daan toog ci boppu koñ bi, ci diggu ay jumtukaay di woo ñiy romb ñu seetaan liggéeyam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa dane togue thi bopeu kogn bi, thi digue ay jumtoukay di wo gniy romb gnou sétane ligueyam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":139,"row":{"en":"Talk to your doctor today and start on the path to recovery.","wo":"Gaawal seeti sa doktër ndax tàmbali tegu ci yoonu wér.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGaawal séti sa docteur ndakh tambali teugu thi yonou wérr.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":140,"row":{"en":"I loved the way magazines could transport me to different worlds and make me think about things in new ways.","wo":"Lima neexoon ci magazine yi mooy niñu ma mëne yóbbu ci beneen àdduna, di soppi sama gis-gis ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima nékhone si magazine yi moy nignou ma meune yobou si beneen addouna, di sopi sama guiss-guiss si addouna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":141,"row":{"en":"The hippie movement was a social and cultural phenomenon that emerged in the United States during the 1960s.","wo":"Hippi benn fenomen sosiaal la woon ak aada bu fekk baax ca Etats Unis ci ati 1960.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHippi benn fenomene social la wone ak aada bou fekk bakh ca Etats Unis thi ati 1960.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":142,"row":{"en":"When these organisms enter the body, they can trigger an immune response that leads to inflammation.","wo":"Su jangoro yooyu duggee sa yaram, mën nañu tax yaram wi di xeex ak ñoom, mooy indi inflamasioŋ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou jangoro yoyou dougué sa yaram, meun nagnou takh yaram wi di khekh ak gnom, moy indi inflammation.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":143,"row":{"en":"I don't know. She just said she wasn't feeling it anymore.","wo":"Xamuma sax. Dafa ni diggante bi neexatuko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamouma sakh dafa ni diguenté bi nékhatouko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":144,"row":{"en":"It is a pain that pierces the soul and leaves us feeling empty and alone.","wo":"Metit la wuy bënn sa xol ruuh gi, bàyyi la nga melni xott ba noppi wéet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMétite la way beunn sa khol rouh gui bayila nga melni khotte ba nopi wéte.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":145,"row":{"en":"Apparently, it was sold to a company that plans to convert it into a chocolate factory and museum.","wo":"Daa melni dañu jaay benn kompiñi bu ko bëgga soppi def ko usine chocolat ak musée.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaa melni daniou djay benn kompiñi bouko beuga sopi defko usine chocolat ak muséé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":146,"row":{"en":"We got out of our cars and started yelling at each other even louder.","wo":"Ku nekk génn ci otoom, nu tàmbali ku nekk di yuuxu moroomam nu gëna kawe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou nek guenn thi auto wam, niou tambali kou nek di youkhou moromam niou geuna kawé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":147,"row":{"en":"He knows that she is a good actress and that she will be able to pull this off, so he gives her a pep talk and tells her to go out there and do her best.","wo":"Xamna ni doomam aktris bu mag la, te leer nako ni lii dina ci génn, mu daal di wax ak moom, niko génn te jouer lumu mën, dina baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamna ni doomame actrice bou mague la té leer nako ni li dina si guénne mou daldi wakh ak mome niko guénne té jouer loumou meune dina bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":148,"row":{"en":"Pain is caused by the release of inflammatory chemicals and the pressure of the swelling.","wo":"Liy waral metit bi mooy substance inflamatoire bi ñuy génne ak dooley newwi gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi waral metite bi moy substance inflamatoire bi gnuy guéné ak doley newwi gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":149,"row":{"en":"Typical clinical signs begin with mild lethargy, reduced feed intake, slight cough, nasal discharge and a fever.","wo":"Màndarga yi ñuy xàmmee feebar bi mooy nelaw yu xóot te gudd, lekk gu néew, sëqët su bariwul, bakkan buy sottiku, ak yaram wu tàng.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMandarga yi gnuy hamé fébar bi moy nelaw you khote té goud, lekk gou néw, seuket sou bariwoul, bakhan bouy sottikou, ak yaram wou tang.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":150,"row":{"en":"Turn on the heat function to improve the overall blood circulation of the body and treat muscle fatigue.","wo":"Taalal man-manu tàngoor bi ngir deret ji yépp gëna mëna daw bu baax wàññi coono sidit yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaatal man manou tangor bi nguir deret dji yeup geuna meuna daw bou bakh wani thiono sidit yi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":151,"row":{"en":"Rainstorms can also be a source of entertainment, as people enjoy watching the rain and listening to the thunder.","wo":"Taw mën na jural nit bànneex ndax amna ñu bëgg di xool muy taw ñuy deglu dënn yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTaw meun na dioural nitt banékh ndakh amna gnou beug di khol mouy taw gnuy deglou deunn yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":152,"row":{"en":"We didn't have all these video games and computers to entertain us.","wo":"Amu nu woon ay jeu video wala ordinatër ngir bégal sunu xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmou gnou wone ay jeu vidéo wala ordinateur nguir beugal sounou khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":153,"row":{"en":"She had achieved her dream, and she had shown the world that anything is possible if you work hard and never give up.","wo":"Tay ndaw si amna lu mu yàngoon a bëgg ci xolam, wan na àdduna ni xëcci bu daggul dikk soo xàddiwul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTay ndaw si amna loumou yangone beug si kholam, wané na aduna ni kheuthie bou dagoule dikk so khadiwoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":154,"row":{"en":"This woman was a morphine addict who had a litter of kittens.","wo":"Ndaw soosu daan yar ay muus daa demoon ba yàqu ci morphine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdaw sossou dane yar ay mouss da demone ba yakhou si morphine.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":155,"row":{"en":"Cry it out if you need to.","wo":"Soo bëggee jooy jooyal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo beugué dioy dioyal rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":156,"row":{"en":"The kit consists of two wheels and the struts that mount to the frame of the bicycle.","wo":"Kit bi dafa am ñaari pëno ak tànki doole yu ñuy fikse ci kaadaru welo bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKit bi dafa am gnari peuno ak tanki dolé you gnuy fikse thi kaadarou vélo bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":157,"row":{"en":"The boys were surprised to hear this from Lily, but they listened to her and stopped throwing rocks.","wo":"Xale góor yi waaru ci li Lily wax, waaye terewul ñu déggal ko ba noppi bàyyi sànni xeer yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé goor yii warou si li lily wakh wayé térewoul gnou déggal ko ba nopi bayi sanni khér yii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":158,"row":{"en":"Dolls and doll accessories are a popular way for children to play and learn.","wo":"Puppe yi ak yu sew yi ñuy àndal, anam wu siiw la wu xale yi di fowee ak di jàngee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPouppé yi ak you sew yi gnuy andal anam wou siw la wou khalé yi di fowé ak di diangue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":159,"row":{"en":"Grandchild: Thank you, Grandma.","wo":"Sët bi: Jërëjëf maam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSet bi: Dieureudieuf mame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":160,"row":{"en":"It’s tall and slender, with long, spindly legs.","wo":"Dafa njool ba noppi sew, am tànk yu gudd te laccax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa gnool ba noppi sew, am tank you goud te lathakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":161,"row":{"en":"She wore a white dress that flowed around her like a mist.","wo":"Mingi sol robb bu weex mu melni laxasaay ci moom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui sol rob bou wekh mou melni lakhassay thi mom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":162,"row":{"en":"Although they lost all their money they continued to behave in their usual wealthy way in their social circle.","wo":"Ak liñu ñakk sen xaalis yępp ñungi wey di def sen dundinu way am xaalis yawon ci sen biir wërgalu mbootaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAk lignou gnakk seen khaliss yeupp gnoungui weuy di def seen doundinou way am khaliss yawone si seen biir weurgalou mbootaay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":163,"row":{"en":"She was reported missing on Tuesday, and search teams were dispatched to find her.","wo":"Talaata lañu yëgle ni dafa réer, ci noonu ekipu seet yi tas di ko wër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTalaata lagnou yeuglé ni dafa rér, thi nonou ekhipou séte yi tass di ko weur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":164,"row":{"en":"Albert Einstein was a German-born theoretical physicist who developed the theory of relativity, one of the two pillars of modern physics (alongside quantum mechanics).","wo":"Albert Einstein physicien ak theoricien la bu juddoo Allamagne, moo taxawal li ñuy woowe theorie de la relativite, di benn ci ponki physique moderne (ak physique mechanique).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAlbert Einstein physicien ak theoricien la bou juddo allamagne, mo takhawal li niouy wowé theorie de la relativité, di bene ci ponki physique moderne (ak physique mechanique).\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":165,"row":{"en":"And then, an abandoned house, the yard filled with rustic, useless junk scattered about.","wo":"Ak, ab kër buñu bayyi, ëtt gangi fees dell ak ay yëf yu ñacc Maanaa, yu amul njeriñ te tasaaro.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAhh ab keur bouniou bayi, eutt gangui fess dell ak ay yeuf you gnacc manaa you amoul ndieuriñ te tasaaro.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":166,"row":{"en":"What is it that draws us to these magnificent creatures?","wo":"Waaye lan moo nu neex ci mbindéef yu taaru yooyu?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé lane mo gnou nékh si mbindéfe you taarou yoyou ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":167,"row":{"en":"The manager was also a problem.","wo":"Lépp patroŋ bi moo ko waral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLepp patron bi moko waral.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":168,"row":{"en":"Patient: I try to get at least 30 minutes of exercise most days of the week.","wo":"Malaad bi: Bis yu gëna bari ci ayu-bis bi dinaa fexe numa defee 30 simili di tàggat sama yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi: Biss you geuna bari ci ayou biss bi dinaa fekhé nouma défé 30 simili di taggat sama yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":169,"row":{"en":"Rih, a deaf former soldier, plots rebellion while married to a queer, teenage god.","wo":"Rih, ab soldar won bu tëx, defa taxawal fippu ci bamudon sey ak ab gorjigeen bu doon xale lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRih ab soldat wone bou teukh dafa takhawal fippou si bamoudone seuy ak ab gor djiguéne bou done khalé lole.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":170,"row":{"en":"These packages typically include a set number of days of rental, as well as unlimited mileage and other extras.","wo":"Xeetu kofre yooyu dañuy àndaale ak yenn diiru luwaas, kilometrage bu amul àpp ak yeneen xéewal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhéétou coffre yoyou daniouy andalé ak yenn diirou louasse, kilométrage bou amoul ape ak yénéne khéwal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":171,"row":{"en":"The pacing could be a little tighter, and some of the characters are a bit one-dimensional.","wo":"Ritm bi mën na gëna seere, ba noppi yenn ci personage yi dañu yam ci benn jikko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRythme bi meun na geuna seéré ba nopi yenn thi personnage yi daniou yam thi bene djikko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":172,"row":{"en":"There's something about the sight of a steam locomotive chuffing along the tracks that just takes me back in time.","wo":"Amna lu yéeme lu nekk may gis saxaaru vapër di daw ci raay yi, di yóbbu sama xel at yu bari ci ginaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna lou yémé lou nek may guiss saharou vapeur di daw thi ray yi, di yobou sama hel at you bari thi guinaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":173,"row":{"en":"Mum unlocks it and we rush outside.","wo":"Sama yaay tijji buntu bi nu daw génn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama yay tidji bount bi niou daw guenn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":174,"row":{"en":"[A group of people are gathered in a large room. They are all wearing white robes and have their heads bowed.]","wo":"[Nit ñu bari ñoo dajaloo ci néeg bu yaatu. Ñoom ñépp dañu sol robb yu weex ba noppi sëggal seen bopp.]","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gnou bari gno dadialoo si néegue bou yaatou. Gnom gneup daniou sol robe you weukh ba nopi seggal sen bopp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":175,"row":{"en":"From the common cold to the bubonic plague, countless diseases have ravaged our species, causing pain, suffering, and death.","wo":"Dalee ko ci soj ba ci mbasum peste bubobik, barina feebar yu faagaagal doomi aadama yi, jural leen metit, tiis ak ñu ñàkk ci seen bakkan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDalee ko thi sodj ba thi mbasoum peste bobou bi, barina feebar you faagaagal domi adama yi, djural len metite, tiiss ak niou niakk thi seen bakane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":176,"row":{"en":"Inpatient care is provided by hospital inpatient departments, emergency departments and outpatient clinics.","wo":"Ñi yor wàllu faj malaad yi ñooy bànxaas yi ñuy fajee ci hopitaal bi ak bànxaas bi yor paj mu jamp ak klinik yi nekk ci biti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGni yor wallou fadji malaadji gnoy bankhass yi gnuy fadjee si hopital bi ak bankhass bi yor padj mou djamp ak clinik yi nek si biti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":177,"row":{"en":"They sought to preserve a broad established church, with generous freedom of worship and association outside it.","wo":"Deñ don wuuta aar ab eglis bu jota taxaw bu baax, libarte bu doy ci jaamu ak booloo ci bitim.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagn done wouta aar ab eglise bou diota takhaw bou bakh, liberté bou doy si diamou ak boolo si bitim.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":178,"row":{"en":"Economic decline and absence of employment opportunities, especially as inequality grows, likewise drives conflict.","wo":"Koom-koom guy dellu ginaaw, ñàkkum xëy, bu ñiy ñàkk di gëna ñàkk, ñi am di gëna am, luni melni dafay yee fitna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKoom kom guy dellou guinaw, gnakkoum heuy, bou gnii gnakk di geuna gnakk, gnii ame di geuna ame, louni melni dafay yé fitna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":179,"row":{"en":"We're willing to make an exception for you. We'll accept your portfolio, but you'll have to pay a processing fee.","wo":"Bëgg nañu la beral loxo. Dina nu jël sa portfëy, waaye yaa wara fay fere yi ci nara topp yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeug nagnou la béral lokho. Dina gnou dieul sa portefeuille wayé ya wara faye feré yi ci nara top yeupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":180,"row":{"en":"Dad looks up from the TV. What is it? he asks.","wo":"Sama pàppa taxaw ci wetu tele bi xool. Muni, lu xew?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama papa takhaw thi wetou télé bi khol. Mouni, lou heuw?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":181,"row":{"en":"I wanted to be free to pursue my own dreams, to learn and grow, and to make a difference in the world.","wo":"Dama bëggoon moom sama bopp topp sama mébet, jàng, màgg ba noppi indi coppite ci àdduna bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama beugone mom sama bopp top sama mébéte diangue mague ba nopi indi coppité si aduna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":182,"row":{"en":"After we donated, we were given a juice box and a cookie to help us recover.","wo":"Ginaaw binu mayee ba noppi, ñu jox nu jus ak ay kukiis ngir defaraat sunu yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw bignou mayé ba nopi, gnou diokh gnou jus ak ay kukiis nguir defaraat sounou yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":183,"row":{"en":"The Kitten Lady was devastated by the loss of her kittens, but she was unable to stop her addiction.","wo":"Xolu Boroom Muus yu ndaw yi daal di jeex ndax muus yiy faatu, waaye mënatul woon bàyyi drog bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKholou borom mous you ndaw yii daal di diekh ndakh mous yiy faatou wayé meunatoul wone bayi drogue bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":184,"row":{"en":"The documents indicated that Ford was involved in funding a suite of classes for institutions like \"Para Nosotras\".","wo":"Këyit dañu wane ni Ford dañu tudd cib dosiye buy wax ni dafa doon dugal xaalisam ci kuréel yu melni \"Para Nosotras\".","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKeyit daniou wané ni Ford daniou toud thi cib dossier bouy wakh ni dafa done dougal khalisam thi koureul you melni \"Para Nosotras\".\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":185,"row":{"en":"Many people wake up before sunrise to start their day's work.","wo":"Barina nit ñuy yewwu balaa jant bi di fenk ngir tàmbali seen liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina nitt gnuy yeuwou bala djant bi di feunk nguir tambali seen ligueye.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":186,"row":{"en":"Their internal hierarchy is based on violence and fear in a constant battle for dominance.","wo":"Ilifante bi nekk sen biir mungi sukkandiku ci meetital ak tiit ci ab xeex budul jeex ngir feetoo kaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nIlifanté bi nekk sen biir moungui soukkandikou thi meetital ak tiit thi ab khekh boudoul diékh nguir féto kaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":187,"row":{"en":"They can cause a variety of symptoms, including fatigue, nausea, and vomiting.","wo":"Mën na feeñee ci anam yu bari, lu ci melni coono, xel mu teey wala waccu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun na fégneu si anam you bari lou si melni thiono khel mou téy wala wathieu.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":188,"row":{"en":"She was about to give up when she saw a man approaching.","wo":"Bimu demee bay waaja xàddi mu gis genn góor di ñëw ci moom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBimou démé bay wadia khaddi mou guiss gene goor di gneuw thi mom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":189,"row":{"en":"This ball of fire was the sun.","wo":"Bulu safara boobu mooy jant bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoulou safara bobou moye djant bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":190,"row":{"en":"They have been posting flyers and distributing missing person's posters around the city.","wo":"Fu nekk ñu ngi fay taf afisu ku réer ci dëkk bi boole ci séddale ay flayër ci biir dëkk bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFou nek gnou ngui fay taf affiche kou rér thi deuk bi bolé thi sedalé ay flyer thi biir deuk bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":191,"row":{"en":"When Ramasamy saw the snake, he was terrified.","wo":"Bi Ramasamy gisee jaan ji dafa tiit bay lox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi Ramasamy guissé diane dji dafa tiite bay lokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":192,"row":{"en":"Plan meals from the cupboard contents and bake bread, soak beans, knead dough, peel things as necessary.","wo":"Waaj len toggu yi jeleeko ci li ci biir armuwar bi te lakk mburu, xooj ñebbe, jamb fariñ, xolli ay yëf yu am njeriñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaadj len togue yi dieuléko ci li ci biir armoire bi te lakk mbeurou, khoj niebé, jamb farign, kholli ay yeuf you ame ndierigne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":193,"row":{"en":"The whisk, the tongs, the ladle, the spatula - each has its own meaning, its own purpose.","wo":"Fuwe, keppukaay, luus, spatule - bu nekk amna lu muy tekki, bu nekk amna njariñam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFoué, kepeukaay, luuss, spatule - bou nek amna loumouy tekki, bou nek amna ndiarignam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":194,"row":{"en":"I felt a wave of despair wash over me.","wo":"Ma yëg naqaru yaakaar gu tas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa yeug nakharou yakar gou tass.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":195,"row":{"en":"Our mission: to enable everyone, everywhere to understand the world and express themselves across languages.","wo":"Suñu yéené mooy : fexe ba ku nekk ak fumu mën a nekk mën di jokkalante tek si di wax ak kàllaama yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou yéné moy fékhé ba kou nek ak foumou meun a nek meun di diokhalanté tek si di wakh ak khallaama yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":196,"row":{"en":"Heartbreak, sighed the poet, is the cruelest of afflictions.","wo":"Taalifkat bi dafa ni, Naqaru xol mooy mbugël mi gëna metti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTalifkat bi dafa ni nakharou khol moy mbeugueul mi geuna meti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":197,"row":{"en":"The baker knew that he was lucky to have the ability to bake such delicious bread.","wo":"Lakk-kat bi kontaan lool liko Yàlla dimbali mu mëna defar mburu yu neexee nii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLakk kat bi contane loool liko yalla dimbeuli mou meuna defar mbourou you nékhé nii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":198,"row":{"en":"Neither row number nor column letter in an absolute reference will change.","wo":"Amul benn nimero ligne wala arafu kolon buy soppiku ci royuwaay bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoul ben numero ligne wala arafou colon bouy sopikou si royouway bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":199,"row":{"en":"Do not touch my apples, the tree said. They are not for you.","wo":"Garab gi ni, Bul laal sama pomme, moomoo leen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGarab gui ni, Boul lal sama pomme, momoléne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}